{
  "title": "Aurora · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "클라우드용 분산 저장소를 사용하는 MySQL·PostgreSQL 호환 데이터베이스입니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Aurora</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#guide-1\">쓰기와 읽기를 처리하는 구조</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#guide-2\">용량과 지역 확장</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>데이터베이스</span><span>04 / 62</span></div><h1>Aurora</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Aurora는 <strong>MySQL 또는 PostgreSQL과 호환되는 AWS의 관계형 데이터베이스</strong>입니다. 데이터를 저장하는 계층과 쿼리를 처리하는 인스턴스를 분리해 구성합니다.</p><p>여러 인스턴스가 같은 클러스터 저장소를 사용하고, 저장소는 여러 AZ에 데이터를 복제합니다. 쓰기 처리와 읽기 확장, 장애 전환을 클러스터 단위로 설계할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cluster-volume\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"writer-and-aurora-replicas\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cluster-reader-and-custom-endpoints\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aurora-auto-scaling\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aurora-serverless-v2\"></span><h2>쓰기와 읽기를 처리하는 구조</h2><p><strong>Writer 인스턴스</strong>가 쓰기를 처리하고 Aurora Replica들이 읽기를 나눠 처리합니다. Writer에 문제가 생기면 적절한 Replica가 쓰기 역할로 승격될 수 있습니다.</p><p>애플리케이션은 클러스터 엔드포인트로 쓰기 대상에, 읽기 엔드포인트로 읽기 대상에 연결합니다. 엔드포인트가 바뀌는 상황에도 연결을 다시 맺을 수 있도록 구현합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aurora-global-database\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"failover-and-promotion-tiers\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"backups-pitr-and-cloning\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aurora-standard-and-i-o-optimized\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"backtrack-and-engine-features\"></span><h2>용량과 지역 확장</h2><p>정해진 인스턴스 크기를 선택하거나, 수요에 맞춰 처리 용량을 조절하는 Aurora Serverless v2<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>를 사용할 수 있습니다. 읽기 복제본의 수를 조절하는 것과 각 인스턴스의 처리 용량을 조절하는 것은 별도 선택입니다.</p><p>다른 리전에서 읽거나 재해 복구가 필요하면 Aurora Global Database를 검토합니다. 자동 백업, 복구 시점, 장애 전환 우선순위도 함께 설정합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>Aurora 클러스터의 구성</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ul class=\"concept-flow concept-comparison\"><li><strong>Writer</strong><span>쓰기·읽기 처리</span></li><li><strong>Aurora Replica</strong><span>읽기 분산·승격 후보</span></li><li><strong>공유 저장소</strong><span>여러 AZ에 데이터 복제</span></li></ul><p class=\"diagram-note\">Writer와 Replica는 클러스터의 공유 저장소를 사용합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>상품 조회가 주문 쓰기보다 훨씬 많은 서비스에서 쓰기는 Writer로, 상품 조회는 읽기 엔드포인트로 보냅니다. Replica를 여러 AZ에 두어 읽기 확장과 장애 대응에 활용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>Aurora Serverless v2</strong> — 데이터베이스의 수요에 맞춰 인스턴스 처리 용량을 설정한 범위 안에서 자동 조절하는 방식입니다. 지원 엔진·버전과 최소·최대 용량 설정을 확인합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/CHAP_AuroraOverview.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon Aurora? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/Aurora.Integrating.AutoScaling.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon Aurora Auto Scaling with Aurora Replicas ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/aurora-serverless-v2.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Using Aurora serverless ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q057/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q057\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q057\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q057</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q057/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An Aurora application must separate read queries from its writer and distribute them across replicas. Which endpoint should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q057\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the writer endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q057\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway Elastic IP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q057\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The reader endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q057\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume ID</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a>의 reader endpoint는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">읽기 복제본</a>으로 연결을 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q054\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q054\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q054</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can the standby instance of a standard RDS Multi-AZ DB instance deployment serve read queries?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Every standby is readable</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The standby in this deployment type is for failover</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if Route 53 is used</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the network ACL is opened</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스의 standby는 읽기 요청을 처리하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 클러스터와 구분한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q055\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q055\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q055</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q055/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS database has increasing read traffic, and the application can tolerate some replication lag. Which option most directly scales reads?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An additional security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a Multi-AZ DB instance standby</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>가 읽기 요청을 나눈다. 보통 비동기 복제 지연을 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,4\" data-question=\"Q087\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q087\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q087</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q087/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to improve both availability and read throughput for an existing RDS DB instance. Which TWO options address these goals?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q087\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q087\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q087\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q087\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q087\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스는 장애 조치, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>는 읽기 확장에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q056\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q056\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q056</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q056/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS DB instance needs automatic failover, but read scaling is not required. Which deployment should be selected?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DynamoDB DAX</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스 standby는 고가용성을 위한 선택이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">이전 용어 <b>API Gateway</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">다음 용어 <b>AWS Backup</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
